# Data: raw/ 默认全忽略, 但白名单可公开的子集 (Streamlit Cloud 部署需要)
data/raw/
!data/raw/ftc_*
!data/raw/pedro_*
!data/raw/737_max_mcas.md
!data/raw/飞机基本原理*
!data/raw/zhihuishe_README_INDEX.md
!data/raw/zhihuishe_CHANGELOG.md
!data/raw/zhihuishe_CONTRIBUTING.md
!data/raw/zhihuishe_docs_*

# Embeddings: FAISS index ~2MB 提交到 git, 部署到 Streamlit Cloud 直接用, 不用每次 cold-start 重建
# (bge-reranker 模型太大 2.16GB, 留在 models/ 仍 ignore, 部署时 sentence-transformers 自动下)
# *.faiss / *.pkl 不全局 ignore, 让 data/embeddings/*.faiss + *.pkl 提交
*.npy
*.npz

# Local model weights (downloaded separately, not versioned)
models/
*.safetensors
*.bin

